[11809]="700307F3\n1\tDefeat Orcs near the East Wall (total: 10)\tWinsig and her men have been facing great difficulty in containing the Orc invasion of the Sutcrofts from the East Wall. Orcs can be found near the pathway to the East Wall to the north of Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Winsig\tWinsig can be found inside the mead-hall of Walstow in south-eastern Sutcrofts.\n",
[11810]="700255F3\n1\tMount a race-horse\030Mount a race-pony\tThe festival steeds can be found spoiling for the race in the stable at the Bree-fields Festival Grounds. You should mount a steed to begin the race -- a pony if you are shorter in stature, or a horse if you are of a taller build. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tCross the starting line to enter the race-track\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRace to the first gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRace to the second gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tRace through the low third gate through sticky mud\030Race through the high third gate over the precarious jump\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRace to the fourth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tRace to the fifth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRace through the low sixth gate through sticky mud\030Race through the high sixth gate over the precarious jump\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRace to the seventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRace to the eighth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tCross the finish line before the time runs out\tThe finish line is near! You must cross the finish line before the time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tSpeak with Sally Threshing\tSally Threshing stands next to the finish line at the race-track in Bree. You should speak with Sally Threshing and inform her of your success.\n",
