hrough all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRace through the low sixth gate through sticky mud\030Race through the high sixth gate over the precarious jump\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRace to the seventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRace to the eighth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Bree-fields' Festival Ground. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tCross the finish line before the time runs out\tThe finish line is near! You must cross the finish line before the time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tSpeak with Sally Threshing\tSally Threshing stands next to the finish line at the race-track in Bree. You should speak with Sally Threshing and inform her of your success.\n",
[11817]="70058A47\n1\tDefeat Wyrmsgráf breeders at Nathból\tThe nesting grounds of Nathból can be found in Elderslade. You should defeat Wyrmsgráf breeders found at Nathból.\n2\tDefeat Wyrmsgráf breeders at Nathból (total: 6)\tThe nesting grounds of Nathból can be found in Elderslade. You should defeat Wyrmsgráf breeders found at Nathból.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Wyrmsgráf breeders at Nathból.\n",
[11818]="70021CDE\n1\tComplete 'A Weapon of Old'\030Complete 'The Half-orcs'\030Complete 'Signs Among the Ashes'\030Complete 'Where There is Smoke....'\tThe brehur of Lhanuch are in the brenin's hall in Lhanuch. Dufrig has told you to earn the favour of the brehur of Lhanuch before Glynn Brenin's council comes to a decision on whether to bow to the demands of Isengard.\n2\tConvince Glynn Brenin to reject the emissary's demands\tDufrig is in the brenin's hall in Lhanuch. You should speak with Dufrig to enter the brenin's hall and observe the deliberations of the Council of Brehur.\n",
[11819]="70062CE4\n1\tExamine the first bridge\030Examine the second bridge\030Examine the third bridge\030Examine the fourth bridge\030Examine the fifth bridge\030Examine the sixth bridge\tPonta Gochelgar has asked you to examine the bridges of Glyn Helyg for signs of rot and wear. The bridges span the gaps along the cliffs of Glyn Helyg.\n2\tReport back to Ponta\tYou should report back to Ponta about the state of the bridges. Ponta Gochelgar is in Glyn Helyg.\n",
[11820]="700715A7\n1\tSpeak with Katâl outside Hurum Kâna\tSpeak with Katâl outside the caves of Hurum Kâna. Hurum Kâna can be found in Kighân to the north of Zajâna, just off the Great Road.\n",
[11821]="70065AE9\n1\tApproach the camp at Thama Aklam to determine possible goings on.\t\n2\tDefeat brigands in Thama Aklam (total: 12)\030Defeat brigand leaders (total: 2)\tThama Aklam has become home to a number of brigands, many of whom are bored and hope for a fight worthy of their skills. Defeat brigands in Thama Aklam.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many brigands in Thama Aklam.\n",
[11822]="7002EB30\n1\tFind the small band of brigands who robbed the farmer\tThe farmer indicated that the brigands may have wandered south-west from his farm after robbing him. You should find the small band of brigands who robbed the farmer at dawn.\n2\tDefeat brigands at Eastmund's Lair (total: 12)\tThe brigands of Eastmund's Lair in the northern Wold are of a hostile nature, and pose a threat to the upstanding folk of Langhold. You should defeat many brigands in an effort to drive them out.\n3\tTell Dala of the brigand encampment that has emerged to the south-west\tDala can be found at the north gate of Langhold. You should return to Dala.\n",
[11823]="7000834E\n1\tTalk to Othran\030Collect Hunting Supplies\tOthran is at Tyrn Lhuig, the hunting-camp in the south-western corner of Malenhad, east of Fasach-larran. Taraghlan has asked you to bring the supplies to his kinsman Othran at the hunting camp in Malenhad.\n",
[11824]="700375D3\n1\tTalk to Torferth to march upon Stoke\tThane Torferth is at Tordag's encampment near Torsbury. You should speak with Thane Torferth when you are ready to march upon Stoke.\n2\tTalk to Torferth\tThane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Thane Torferth regarding Ordlac and his treachery.\n",
[11825]="7005CC7F\n1\tSearch for the park\tDanakh-khêj is in northern Clovengap. You should search for the ruins of the Danakh-khêj park.\n2\tExplore the park\tDanakh-khêj is in northern Clovengap. You should explore Danakh-khêj park.\n3\tReturn to Gerja\tGerja Defthand is in north-east Clovengap. You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found in the park.\n",
[11826]="70030980\n1\tFind Fastred in his home\tFastred is inside his home in Snowbourn. Despite Cynelac's warnings, you should warn Fastred of the impending attack on Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Fastred\tFastred can be found inside his home in Snowbourn. While this is not the best moment to intrude upon his time, you must warn Fastred of the coming danger.\n3\tTalk to Gísling\tGísling can be found in central Snowbourn. Since Fastred will not hear you, you should speak with Gísling.\n",
[11827]="70053E39\n1\tSeek out Dáru Lagúrz\030Defeat kergrim (total: 10)\tKergrim can be found in Rath Dúath. You should defeat kergrim in Rath Dúath and seek out Dáru Lagúrz.\n2\tDefeat Broglok, overseer of Dáru Lagúrz\tBroglok can be found in Dáru Lagúrz. You should defeat Broglok.\n3\tFollow the path to Gorthad Nûr\tShalgoth fled to Gorthad Nûr. You should follow Shalgoth.\n4\tTalk to Thurindol outside Gorthad Nûr\tThurindol can be found outside Gorthad Nûr. You should talk to Thurindol.\n",
[11828]="7004A8FE\n1\tCollect phials of spider ichor (total: 8)\030Collect phials of grodbog ichor (total: 8)\030Collect phials of crawler ichor (total: 8)\030Collect phials of carrion-fly ichor (total: 8)\tIchor can be harvested from various creatures in Lhingris. Legolas has asked you to gather ichor from the many insects and spiders of Lhingris.\n2\tDeliver the phials of ichor to Legolas near Dath Nethryn\tLegolas can be found beside the road above the swamps of Dath Nethryn. You have gathered a great deal of ichor from the creatures of Lhingris and should now return to Legolas.\n",
[11829]="7001EE03\n1\tDefeat Guldur Brutes (total: 4)\tSammath Gûl, a tower deep within Dol Guldur, is in the Eastern reaches of southern Mirkwood. Naerdolen has asked you to enter Sammath Gûl and defeat many Guldur Brutes.\n",
[11830]="7005A675\n1\tDefeat hobgoblin brutes (total: 8)\030Destroy hobgoblin wards (total: 10)\tHobgoblin brutes and hobgoblin wards can be found in western Máttugard. You should defeat hobgoblin brutes and destroy their wards.\n2\tTalk to Voina\tVoina can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset, in Máttugard. You should talk to Voina.\n",
[11831]="70038601\n1\tTalk to Ellen Fremedon in Underharrow\tEllen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in the Harrowdale. Éowyn has asked that you aid Ellen Fremedon in preparing for the people of Kingstead as they journey to Dunharrow.\n",
[11832]="70066BD3\n1\tRecover buried coins (total: 6)\tHúrwen has asked you to search for sacks of coin that her father secreted about her farm. Elbery Farm is located in north-western Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tReturn to Húrwen\tYou have recovered multiple sacks of coins from Elbery Farm. You should bring the sacks of coin to Húrwen, who is waiting on the road west of Elbery, in Pinnath Gelin.\n",
[11833]="700358F2\n1\tLocate the crypt in the middle of Lake Isingmere\tHead to the island in the middle of Lake Isingmere and find the crypt located there.\n2\tOpen the wailing Daegul's casket deep within the crypt\tEnter the crypt and look for the the wailing Daegul's casket located deep within.\n3\tDefeat the captor Daegul located deep within the crypt\tThe captor Daegul is not pleased that it has been disturbed.\n4\tSpeak with the wailing Daegul\tNow that the captor Daegul has been defeated, the wailing Daegul will no longer be bound to the lighthouse.\n",
[11834]="70009799\n1\tInvestigate Tyl Ruinen\tThe island of Tyl Ruinen on the west side of the lake, opposite Tinnudir, has become infested with salamanders. Calatherdir has asked you to make the journey to Tyl Ruinen and the ruin of Tollobel to investigate the salamanders that have appeared there.\n",
[11835]="7004A33D\n1\tGather obsidian ore\tGather obsidian ore.\n2\tGather obsidian ore (total: 8)\tGather obsidian ore.\n3\tBring the obsidian ore to Candúr\tReturn to Candúr with the obsidian ore.\n",
[11836]="7004A33B\n1\tDefeat The Blood-blade\tDefeat The Blood-blade.\n2\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[11837]="7004A33C\n1\tDefeat Merrevail on Mount Doom\tDefeat Merrevail on Mount Doom.\n2\tDefeat Merrevail on Mount Doom (total: 15)\tDefeat Merrevail on Mount Doom.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and inform him of your deeds on Mount Doom.\n",
[11838]="7004A0AF\n1\tTravel to the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth\tThe Ruins of Díngarth is located near Udûn in Dor Amarth. You should travel to the Ruins of Díngarth.\n2\tTalk to Ingold\030Talk to Gimli\tGimli and Ingold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth. When you have completed all you wish to do in Udûn you should speak to Gimli and Ingold.\n",
[11839]="700454FD\n1\tDefeat Rimmon Burrowers (total: 10)\tRimmon Burrowers can be found in the Rimmon Quarry. You should defeat Rimmon Burrowers.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many cave-claws in the Beacon Hills.\n",
[11840]="7005466B\n1\tFind the Straight Stair\tThe Straight Stair marks the start of your journey into Cirith Ungol. You can find it through a pass just behind Halhir, who is stationed along the Morgul-road.\n2\tFind Echad Taerdim\tEchad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol under command of Mablung, can be found at the top of the Straight Stair. You should travel to Echad Taerdim.\n3\tTalk to Legolas\tLegolas can be found at Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol. You should talk to Legolas.\n4\tTalk to Mablung\030Talk to Mírthel\030Talk to Gladhir\tLegolas believes the first course of action is to gather information from the Rangers of Ithilien stationed at Echad Taerdim. You should talk to Mablung, Mírthel, and Gladhir.\n5\tTalk to Legolas\tLegolas is waiting for you in Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol. You should talk to Legolas.\n",
})
